#: ../../annotation.rst:2 415420149aab484db5b62017f3cc1bb8
msgid "Cell-type annotation"
msgstr "Cell-type annotation"

#: ../../annotation.rst:4 f8eff701731347879352ecc05d8ded12
msgid ""
"Asc-Seurat provides **automated cell-type annotation** via `SingleR "
"<https://bioconductor.org/packages/release/bioc/html/SingleR.html>`_. Use "
"the **Cell-type Annotation** entry under *Tools* to run SingleR against a "
"``celldex`` reference atlas and attach predicted cell-type labels to the "
"clustered object. The module works on objects produced by the Single Sample "
"or Integration tabs, or on processed Seurat RDS files uploaded directly."
msgstr ""
"Asc-Seurat fornece **anotação cell-type automatizada** via `SingleR "
"<https://bioconductor.org/packages/release/bioc/html/SingleR.html>`_. Use a "
"entrada **Cell-type Annotation** em *Tools* para executar SingleR em um "
"atlas de referência ``celldex`` e anexar rótulos previstos de cell-type ao "
"objeto com clustering. O módulo funciona em objetos produzidos pelas guias "
"Single Sample ou Integration, ou em arquivos processados ​​Seurat RDS "
"carregados diretamente."

#: ../../annotation.rst:17 468959b726cd427c8c0f098f1967291f
msgid "Cell-type Annotation tab (SingleR)."
msgstr "Guia Cell-type Annotation (SingleR)."

#: ../../annotation.rst:17 258fddb3752246b19b3e23389e7aba9a
msgid ""
"Cell-type Annotation tab. Point it at a processed Seurat object (from the "
"Single Sample or Integration tab, or uploaded as RDS), choose a ``celldex`` "
"reference atlas, and pick main or fine labels."
msgstr ""
"Cell-type Annotation guia. Aponte-o para um objeto Seurat processado (da "
"guia Single Sample ou Integration, ou carregado como RDS), escolha um atlas "
"de referência ``celldex`` e escolha rótulos principais ou finos."
